OL,3,GNEWSAHope restoring historic ponds will
OL,4,Aboost wildlife
OL,5,
OL,6,FRestoring Cannop Ponds in the Forest of
OL,7,FDean will help the area to become a
OL,8,Fhaven for wildlife, says Forestry
OL,9,FEngland.
OL,11,FThe first images have been released by
OL,12,FForestry England showing what the two
OL,13,Freservoirs will look like when the
OL,14,Fproject is completed.
OL,16,FA new slipway will be created on the
OL,17,FLower Cannop reservoir, the dam will
OL,18,Falso be strengthened, while the Upper
OL,19,FCannop will be improved with a mixture
OL,20,Fof open water marsh and reedbeds.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
